@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@listId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@itemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@authToken = your-auth-token-here

### 1. View Public List (Anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lists/{{listId}}

### 2. View Public List (Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lists/{{listId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Claim Gift (Anonymous)
# @name anonymousClaim
POST {{baseUrl}}/lists/{{listId}}/items/{{itemId}}/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityClaimed": 1,
  "claimerName": "Anna"
}

### Extracted revocation token
@revocationToken = {{anonymousClaim.response.body.revocationToken}}

### 4. Unclaim Gift with Revocation Token (Anonymous)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lists/{{listId}}/items/{{itemId}}/claims?revocationToken={{revocationToken}}

### 5. Claim Gift (Authenticated User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lists/{{listId}}/items/{{itemId}}/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityClaimed": 1,
  "claimerName": "Santa"
}

### 6. Unclaim Gift (Authenticated User - without revocation token)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lists/{{listId}}/items/{{itemId}}/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Adopt Claims by Revocation Tokens (Authenticated User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lists/claims/adopt
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "revocationTokens": [
    "{{revocationToken}}"
  ]
}
